$HOME/.config/ghostty/themes/ --> add theme files here and then change theme in config file
$HOME/.config/ghostty/config.ghostty --> config file location

install a new version of python with pyenv install 3.12.12(example). to set global/local(for the directory) version of python type pyenv global/local 3.12.12. To unistall -> pyenv uninstall 3.12.12

find ~ -iname "*vscode*" -o -iname "*visual studio code*"

pip cache purge

npm installs for LazyVim -> tree-sitter-cli

brew cleanup --prune=all --> cleanup all files instead of just files older than 120 days
brew installs on fresh mac:->
1. brew install --cask ghostty
2. brew install starship
3. brew install zsh-autosuggestions
4. brew install stow node neovim pyenv
5. brew install openssl readline sqlite3 xz tcl-tk@8 libb2 zstd zlib pkgconfig (for pyenv[build dependencies])
6. brew install fzf ripgrep fd lazygit fastfetch
7. brew install --cask obsidian zed antigravity-cli codex brave-browser google-chrome
8. brew install yazi zsh-syntax-highlighting eza
9. brew install mole openjdk maven ollama

if you want custom brew cask install location then do this ->
--appdir=/Volumes/SN7100-500GB/Applications

to completely remove leftover files and folders of casks when uninstalling do this ->
brew uninstall --cask --zap <cask-name>
